    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315910/extras/7b20d0ab70aae05831c5f030549aa638.poster.avif?t=1743536064\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315910/extras/7b20d0ab70aae05831c5f030549aa638.webm?t=1743536064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315910/extras/7b20d0ab70aae05831c5f030549aa638.mp4?t=1743536064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>SWAP is a third\u2013person adventure game in which you will find yourself in the shoes of a charming but brave cat traveling the galaxy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique planets with breathtaking landscapes, from sand dunes to icy deserts. Solve puzzles, complete quests for colorful inhabitants of planets, fight enemies using feline dexterity and cunning. To overcome all the obstacles, you will need agility, curiosity, insight and an extra 9 lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SWAP is a game that will make you fall in love with yourself from the very first &quot;meow&quot;, with its exciting gameplay, picturesque locations, interesting puzzles, adventurous spirit, as well as a touching protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the furriest adventure of your life!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315910/extras/7b20d0ab70aae05831c5f030549aa638.poster.avif?t=1743536064\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315910/extras/7b20d0ab70aae05831c5f030549aa638.webm?t=1743536064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315910/extras/7b20d0ab70aae05831c5f030549aa638.mp4?t=1743536064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>SWAP is a third\u2013person adventure game in which you will find yourself in the shoes of a charming but brave cat traveling the galaxy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique planets with breathtaking landscapes, from sand dunes to icy deserts. Solve puzzles, complete quests for colorful inhabitants of planets, fight enemies using feline dexterity and cunning. To overcome all the obstacles, you will need agility, curiosity, insight and an extra 9 lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SWAP is a game that will make you fall in love with yourself from the very first &quot;meow&quot;, with its exciting gameplay, picturesque locations, interesting puzzles, adventurous spirit, as well as a touching protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the furriest adventure of your life!</p>",
